<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Job Description Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  p, td, span { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for Logo/Header -->
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="max-width: 150px;">
  </div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">JOB DESCRIPTION TITLE: {{ job_title }}</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">DEPARTMENT: {{ department }}</h3>

  <p><strong>Responsible to:</strong> <span data-field="reporting_to">{{ reporting_to }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>Organizational Classification:</strong> <span data-field="organizational_classification">{{ organizational_classification }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>FLSA Classification:</strong> <span data-field="flsa_classification">{{ flsa_classification }}</span></p>

  <p>The following statements are intended to describe the general nature and level of work being performed. They are not intended to be construed as an exhaustive list of all responsibilities, duties, and skills required of personnel so classified.</p>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">I) Summary of Responsibilities:</h4>
  <p><span data-field="summary_responsibilities">{{ summary_responsibilities }}</span></p>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">II) Essential Responsibilities:</h4>
  <p><span data-field="essential_responsibilities">{{ essential_responsibilities }}</span></p>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">A. Virtual Events and Social Media</h4>
  <ol>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_a1">{{ essential_responsibility_a1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_a2">{{ essential_responsibility_a2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_a3">{{ essential_responsibility_a3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_a4">{{ essential_responsibility_a4 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_a5">{{ essential_responsibility_a5 }}</span></li>
  </ol>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">B. Coordinating Graduate Student Campus Visits</h4>
  <ol>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_b1">{{ essential_responsibility_b1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_b2">{{ essential_responsibility_b2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_b3">{{ essential_responsibility_b3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_b4">{{ essential_responsibility_b4 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="essential_responsibility_b5">{{ essential_responsibility_b5 }}</span></li>
  </ol>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">C. Exhibits behavior that is consistent with and supportive of Geneva's mission, vision and core values:</h4>
  <p><strong>A. Geneva Mission Statement:</strong> <span data-field="mission_statement">{{ mission_statement }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>B. Vision Statement:</strong> <span data-field="vision_statement">{{ vision_statement }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>C. Core Values:</strong></p>
  <ol>
    <li><span data-field="core_value_1">{{ core_value_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="core_value_2">{{ core_value_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="core_value_3">{{ core_value_3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="core_value_4">{{ core_value_4 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="core_value_5">{{ core_value_5 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="core_value_6">{{ core_value_6 }}</span></li>
  </ol>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">IV) Job Requirements – Administrative:</h4>
  <p><strong>A. General:</strong> <span data-field="general_requirements">{{ general_requirements }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>B. Physical:</strong> <span data-field="physical_requirements">{{ physical_requirements }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>C. Confidentiality:</strong> <span data-field="confidentiality_requirements">{{ confidentiality_requirements }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>D. Mental:</strong> <span data-field="mental_requirements">{{ mental_requirements }}</span></p>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">V) Qualifications:</h4>
  <p><strong>A. Minimum:</strong></p>
  <ol>
    <li><span data-field="qualification_minimum_1">{{ qualification_minimum_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="qualification_minimum_2">{{ qualification_minimum_2 }}</span></li>
  </ol>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;"><strong>E.E.O.E. Statement:</strong> <span data-field="eeoe_statement">{{ eeoe_statement }}</span></p>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">Employee Signature</td>
        <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">Date</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">Supervisor Signature</td>
        <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">Date</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">Human Resources</td>
        <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">Date</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for Logo/Header -->
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="max-width: 150px;">
  </div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">JOB DESCRIPTION TITLE: {{ job_title }}</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">DEPARTMENT: {{ department }}</h3>

  <p><strong>Experience:</strong> <span data-field="experience_required">{{ experience_required }}</span></p>
  <p><strong>Skills/Abilities:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="skill_ability_1">{{ skill_ability_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_ability_2">{{ skill_ability_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_ability_3">{{ skill_ability_3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_ability_4">{{ skill_ability_4 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_ability_5">{{ skill_ability_5 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Christian Commitment:</strong> <span data-field="christian_commitment">{{ christian_commitment }}</span></p>

  <h4 style="margin-top: 20px;">B. Preferred:</h4>
  <ol>
    <li><span data-field="preferred_1">{{ preferred_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="preferred_2">{{ preferred_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="preferred_3">{{ preferred_3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="preferred_4">{{ preferred_4 }}</span></li>
  </ol>

  <p style="margin-top: 50px;">GA- Admissions And Outreach Coordinator 8-26-2020</p>
  <p style="text-align: right;">Page 3</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for Logo/Header -->
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="max-width: 150px;">
  </div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">JOB DESCRIPTION TITLE: {{ job_title }}</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">DEPARTMENT: {{ department }}</h3>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>GA- Admissions And Outreach Coordinator 8-26-2020</p>
    <p style="text-align: right;">Page 4</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>